      "Resolve block hash using Blockstream block-height endpoint",
      "Construct only the documented /api/block/{hash} follow-up URL from the resolved hash",
      "Retrieve the exact block record via /api/block/{hash} (external dependency-aware)",
      "Report required fields from the exact block response",
      "Preserve exact returned values and distinctions (hashes, timestamp, size vs weight)",
      "Stop after reporting the resolved hash and the requested block fields"
